DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260913T110000
UID:c2ffc10703902943a5d0f9cc2b3cfa0b@visitsantarosa.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Sugarloaf docents Dana Glei and Shirley Austin-Peek for a
  meditative birding outing. We will start off by sitting quietly for 10 mi
 nutes with Merlin app recording in 3 different locations\, followed by abo
 ut 10 minutes of discussion of the birds we heard\, using Cornell to confi
 rm their calls and songs before moving onto the next sitting spot. We will
  also saunter (while looking for birds) between the locations for a total 
 distance of ~1.3 mile & ~250’ ascent. Birding by ear lends itself to m
LOCATION:Sugarloaf Ridge State Park\, 2605 Adobe Canyon Road\, Kenwood\, C
 A 95452
URL:https://www.visitsantarosa.com/events/meditative-birding-california-bi
 odiversity-day-2026/
X-SOURCE:Visit Santa Rosa
END:VEVENT
