 aluable insights offered by both myth and archetype\, for better clarity a
 nd resilience in today’s tumultuous world. This event features Author an
 d Astrologer Diana Badger discussing her book Dance of the Archetypes: How
  Astrology Informs our Lives and Connects Us to the Earth\, and Author/Poe
 t/Storyteller Brian R. Martens with his book\, Merlin’s Wing\, Mythic Po
 ems
